// ST. BRIELLE: THE INTERVAL
// Game-specific script layer.
//
// The engine automatically checks for script/<fs_game>_main.script after
// compiling the inherited default script set. Keeping this file separate gives
// St. Brielle a clean place for project-only script functions as the game grows.
//
// Intentionally contains no global main() function: the inherited game script
// already owns normal startup. St. Brielle runtime logic is introduced through
// namespaced C++ systems, map scripts, and sb_* script functions.
